      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我老爹老是会往方便面里加下酒菜，再加几根腊香肠，\r\n然后嘟囔些什么“这是特制叉烧！”的鬼话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8d9e89b3321b9650ad5f6e614694baa1d2304735c811383b3c45df1fd74f461",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
